WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Mike might also feel upset because of where he comes from.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:10.400
In some cultures, certain words can really hurt, but in other cultures, those words might be okay to say.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:17.120
Also, families teach different things that are important, like love, respect, honesty, and working hard.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:23.920
If Mike's family always talks about working hard, how do you think he might feel when Mr. Ramos calls him lazy?

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:29.839
A. Angry. B. Sad. C. Embarrassed. Or D. Happy.

